                                                "sense_id": "a8330eaf-c606-34e8-87dc-4862a406d05c",
                                                "text": "At higher airspeeds, the 737's maximum rudder deflection is limited by blowdown, helping to prevent flight-control inputs from overstressing the aircraft's vertical stabilizer."
